[(0, 'id', 'INTEGER', 0, None, 1), (1, 'name', 'TEXT', 1, None, 0), (2, 'encoding_json', 'TEXT', 1, None, 0), (3, 'created_at', 'TEXT', 1, 'CURRENT_TIMESTAMP', 0), (4, 'encoding', 'BLOB', 0, None, 0)]

Step 3: Verified encoding storage format
Command:
python -c "import sqlite3; c=sqlite3.connect('known_faces.db'); cur=c.cursor(); data=cur.execute('select encoding from known_faces limit 1').fetchone()[0]; print(type(data)); c.close()"
